# Proton Mail via Bridge. Bridge runs as a sibling container on the
# `mail` network; mbsync reaches it as protonmail-bridge:143.
# $MAIL_PASSWORD is the Bridge-generated IMAP password (from `info`
# in the Bridge CLI), NOT your Proton account password.

IMAPAccount proton
Host ${MAIL_HOST}
Port ${MAIL_PORT}
User ${MAIL_USER}
PassCmd "echo $MAIL_PASSWORD"
SSLType ${MAIL_SSL}
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore proton-remote
Account proton

MaildirStore proton-local
Path /var/mail/
Inbox /var/mail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel proton
Far :proton-remote:
Near :proton-local:
Patterns ${MAIL_FOLDERS}
Create Near
Sync Pull
Expunge None
SyncState *
MaxMessages ${MAIL_MAX_MESSAGES}
MaxSize ${MAIL_MAX_SIZE}
